mbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"900\" data-file-height=\"600\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rouen_M%C3%A9tropole_Basket\" title=\"Rouen M\u00e9tropole Basket\">Rouen MB</a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Num\u00e9ro\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\">15\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Poste\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Meneur\" title=\"Meneur\">Meneur</a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"padding:4px; text-align:center; background-color:#DD8F56; color:#000000\">Carri\u00e8re universitaire ou amateur</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">2017-2020\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=C%C3%A9gep_de_Vanier&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"C\u00e9gep de Vanier (page inexistante)\">C\u00e9gep de Vanier </a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"padding:4px; text-align:center; background-color:#DD8F56; color:#000000\">Draft de la NBA</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Ann\u00e9e\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Draft_2020_de_la_NBA\" title=\"Draft 2020 de la NBA\">2020</a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Position\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Non draft\u00e9\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"padding:4px; text-align:center; background-color:#DD8F56; color:#000000\">Carri\u00e8re professionnelle *</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:28%;\"><b>Saison</b></td><td><b>Club</b></td><td><b><abbr class=\"abbr\" title=\"Moyenne\">Moy.</abbr> <abbr class=\"abbr\" title=\"points\">pts</abbr></b></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\"><a href=\"/wiki/Saison_NBA_2020-2021\" title=\"Saison NBA 2020-2021\">2020-2021</a><br />2021<br />2021<br />2022<br />2022<br />2024<br />2024-2025<br />2025<br />2025-</td><td valign=\"top\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_d%27Orlando\" title=\"Magic d&#39;Orlando\">Magic d'Orlando</a><br /><span class=\"nowrap\"><span style=\"cursor:help;\" title=\"Pr\u00eat\u00e9 \u00e0\">\u2192</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_de_Lakeland\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Magic de Lakeland\">Magic de Lakeland</a></span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Hustle_de_Memphis\" title=\"Hustle de Memphis\">Hustle de Memphis</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Swarm_de_Greensboro\" title=\"Swarm de Greensboro\">Greensboro Swarm</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Blue_Coats_du_Delaware\" title=\"Blue Coats du Delaware\">Delaware Blue Coats</a><br /><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=BC_Shumen&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"BC Shumen (page inexistante)\">BC Shumen</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Abidjan_Basket_Club_Fighters\" title=\"Abidjan Basket Club Fighters\">ABC Fighters</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Surge_de_Calgary\" title=\"Surge de Calgary\">Surge de Calgary</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Rouen_M%C3%A9tropole_Basket\" title=\"Rouen M\u00e9tropole Basket\">Rouen MB</a></td><td valign=\"top\"><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>1,1<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>5,5</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"padding:4px; text-align:center; background-color:#DD8F56; color:#000000\">S\u00e9lection en \u00e9quipe nationale **</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\">2023-</td><td valign=\"top\"><span class=\"nowrap\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Flag_of_Senegal.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Drapeau : S\u00e9n\u00e9gal\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fd/Flag_of_Senegal.svg/20px-Flag_of_Senegal.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fd/Flag_of_Senegal.svg/40px-Flag_of_Senegal.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"900\" data-file-height=\"600\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/%C3%89quipe_du_S%C3%A9n%C3%A9gal_masculine_de_basket-ball\" title=\"\u00c9quipe du S\u00e9n\u00e9gal masculine de basket-ball\">S\u00e9n\u00e9gal</a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<td colspan=\"3\"><hr style=\"height:2px; color:inherit; background-color:#DD8F56;\" /></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;color:#555555;\"><small>* Points marqu\u00e9s dans chaque club dans le cadre de la saison r\u00e9guli\u00e8re du championnat national.</small></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;color:#555555;\"><small>** Points marqu\u00e9s pour l\u2019\u00e9quipe nationale en match officiel.</small></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"navigation-only\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"border-top: 2px #DD8F56 solid; font-size: 80%; background:inherit; color: inherit; text-align: right;\"><span class=\"plainlinks\" style=\"float:left;\"><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//fr.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Karim_Man%C3%A9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=0\" href=\"https://fr.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Karim_Man%C3%A9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=0\"><span class=\"infodoc\">modifier</span></a></span>&#160;<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mod%C3%A8le:Infobox_Joueur_de_basket-ball\" title=\"Consultez la documentation du mod\u00e8le\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Info_Simple.svg/20px-Info_Simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Info_Simple.svg/40px-Info_Simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></a></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Abdou Karim Man\u00e9</b>, n\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap date-lien\" datetime=\"2000-05-16\" data-sort-value=\"2000-05-16\"><a href=\"/wiki/16_mai_en_sport\" title=\"16 mai en sport\">16 mai</a> <a href=\"/wiki/2000_en_basket-ball\" title=\"2000 en basket-ball\">2000</a></time> \u00e0 <a href=\"/wiki/Dakar\" title=\"Dakar\">Dakar</a> au <a href=\"/wiki/S%C3%A9n%C3%A9gal\" title=\"S\u00e9n\u00e9gal\">S\u00e9n\u00e9gal</a>, est un joueur de basket-ball <a href=\"/wiki/S%C3%A9n%C3%A9gal\" title=\"S\u00e9n\u00e9gal\">s\u00e9n\u00e9galo</a>-<a href=\"/wiki/Canada\" title=\"Canada\">canadien</a> \u00e9voluant aux postes de <a href=\"/wiki/Meneur\" title=\"Meneur\">meneur</a> dans la NBA.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Biographie\">Biographie</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_Man%C3%A9&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Biographie\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_Man%C3%A9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Biographie\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Carri\u00e8re_en_club\"><span id=\"Carri.C3.A8re_en_club\"></span>Carri\u00e8re en club</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_Man%C3%A9&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Carri\u00e8re en club\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_Man%C3%A9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Carri\u00e8re en club\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2020-11-23\" data-sort-value=\"2020-11-23\">23 novembre 2020</time>, il signe un contrat <i>two-way</i> en faveur du <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_d%27Orlando\" title=\"Magic d&#39;Orlando\">Magic d'Orlando</a> devenant ainsi le premier joueur de la province de Qu\u00e9bec \u00e0 aller directement \u00e0 la <a href=\"/wiki/National_Basketball_Association\" title=\"National Basketball Association\">NBA</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>. Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2021-01-06\" data-sort-value=\"2021-01-06\">6 janvier 2021</time>, Karim marqua ses deux premiers points avec les <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_d%27Orlando\" title=\"Magic d&#39;Orlando\">Magic d'Orlando</a> dans une victoire de 105-94 contre les <a href=\"/wiki/Cleveland_Cavaliers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cleveland Cavaliers\">Cleveland Cavaliers</a>. Durant sa premi\u00e8re ann\u00e9e, il a fait partie d\u2019une \u00e9quipe championne comme partant, pour le Magic de Lakeland dans la G League. Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2021-04-13\" data-sort-value=\"2021-04-13\">13 avril 2021</time>, il se fait lib\u00e9rer par son club et devient un agent libre. Apr\u00e8s avoir fait un passage dans l'\u00e9quipe d'<a href=\"/wiki/Hustle_de_Memphis\" title=\"Hustle de Memphis\">Hustle de Memphis</a>, Karim Man\u00e9 rejoint le <a href=\"/wiki/Swarm_de_Greensboro\" title=\"Swarm de Greensboro\">Swarm de Greensboro</a> en <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2022-02\" data-sort-value=\"2022-02\">f\u00e9vrier 2022</time><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>. Il poursuit sa progression le <a href=\"/wiki/Blue_Coats_du_Delaware\" title=\"Blue Coats du Delaware\">Blue Coats du Delaware</a> avant de rejoindre l'\u00e9quipe de basket-ball de Bulgarie de <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=BC_Shumen&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"BC Shumen (page inexistante)\">BC Shumen</a> en 2024. Karim Man\u00e9 quitte la <a href=\"/wiki/Bulgarie\" title=\"Bulgarie\">Bulgarie</a> s'engage en <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2024-09\" data-sort-value=\"2024-09\">septembre 2024</time> avec le club ivoirien d'<a href=\"/wiki/Abidjan_Basket_Club_Fighters\" title=\"Abidjan Basket Club Fighters\">ABC Fighters</a> pour les \u00e9liminatoires du <a href=\"/wiki/Ligue_africaine_de_basket-ball\" title=\"Ligue africaine de basket-ball\">Basketball Africa League</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>. En <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2025-04\" data-sort-value=\"2025-04\">avril 2025</time>, il retourne au Canada et signe avec le <a href=\"/wiki/Surge_de_Calgary\" title=\"Surge de Calgary\">Surge de Calgary</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>. Karim Man\u00e9 quitte le <a href=\"/wiki/Canada\" title=\"Canada\">Canada</a> pour rejoindre le <a href=\"/wiki/Championnat_de_France_de_basket-ball_de_deuxi%C3%A8me_division\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Championnat de France de basket-ball de deuxi\u00e8me division\">PRO B</a> en <a href=\"/wiki/France\" title=\"France\">France</a> avec le <a href=\"/wiki/Rouen_M%C3%A9tropole_Basket\" title=\"Rouen M\u00e9tropole Basket\">Rouen MB</a> en <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2025-08\" data-sort-value=\"2025-08\">ao\u00fbt 2025</time><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Carri\u00e8re_en_\u00e9quipe_nationale\"><span id=\"Carri.C3.A8re_en_.C3.A9quipe_nationale\"></span>Carri\u00e8re en \u00e9quipe nationale</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_Man%C3%A9&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Carri\u00e8re en \u00e9quipe nationale\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_Man%C3%A9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Carri\u00e8re en \u00e9quipe nationale\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>N\u00e9 en 2000 \u00e0 <a href=\"/wiki/Dakar\" title=\"Dakar\">Dakar</a>, Karim Man\u00e9 a quitt\u00e9 le <a href=\"/wiki/S%C3%A9n%C3%A9gal\" title=\"S\u00e9n\u00e9gal\">S\u00e9n\u00e9gal</a> \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e2ge de 7 ans pour s\u2019\u00e9tablir au <a href=\"/wiki/Canada\" title=\"Canada\">Canada</a> avec sa famille. En <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2024-06\" data-sort-value=\"2024-06\">juin 2024</time>, il recouvre sa nationalit\u00e9 sportive s\u00e9n\u00e9galaise et choisit de d\u00e9fendre les couleurs de l'<a href=\"/wiki/%C3%89quipe_du_S%C3%A9n%C3%A9gal_masculine_de_basket-ball\" title=\"\u00c9quipe du S\u00e9n\u00e9gal masculine de basket-ball\">\u00e9quipe nationale du S\u00e9n\u00e9gal de basket-ball</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Palmar\u00e8s\"><span id=\"Palmar.C3.A8s\"></span>Palmar\u00e8s</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_Man%C3%A9&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Palmar\u00e8s\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_Man%C3%A9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Palmar\u00e8s\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><span data-sort-value=\"03\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"M\u00e9daille de bronze, Afrique\"><img alt=\"M\u00e9daille de bronze, Afrique\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/41/Bronze_medal_africa.svg/20px-Bronze_medal_africa.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/41/Bronze_medal_africa.svg/40px-Bronze_medal_africa.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></span></span></span> M\u00e9daill\u00e9 de bronze du <a href=\"/wiki/Championnat_d%27Afrique_masculin_de_basket-ball_2025\" title=\"Championnat d&#39;Afrique masculin de basket-ball 2025\">Championnat d'Afrique masculin de basket-ball 2025</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Notes_et_r\u00e9f\u00e9rences\"><span id=\"Notes_et_r.C3.A9f.C3.A9rences\"></span>Notes et r\u00e9f\u00e9rences</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_Man%C3%A9&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Notes et r\u00e9f\u00e9rences\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Karim_Man%C3%A9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Notes et r\u00e9f\u00e9rences\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"references-small decimal\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://montrealgazette.com/sports/basketball/nba/vanier-star-karim-mane-signs-with-nbas-orlando-magic\">https://montrealgazette.com/sports/basketball/nba/vanier-star-karim-mane-signs-with-nbas-orlando-magic</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"ouvrage\">\u00ab&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://alleyoop360.com/karim-mane-poursuit-sa-progression-avec-le-swarm-de-greensboro\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\">Karim Man\u00e9 poursuit sa progression avec le Swarm de Greensboro | AlleyOop360</cite></a>&#160;\u00bb, sur <span class=\"italique\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://alleyoop360.com\">https://alleyoop360.com</a></span>, <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2022-02-22\" data-sort-value=\"2022-02-22\">22 f\u00e9vrier 2022</time> <small style=\"line-height:1em;\">(consult\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2025-08-08\" data-sort-value=\"2025-08-08\">8 ao\u00fbt 2025</time>)</small></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-3\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"ouvrage\">\u00ab&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiwsport.com/2024/09/27/transfert-karim-mane-sengage-avec-abc-fighters-pour-les-eliminatoires-de-la-bal/\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\">Transfert&#160;: Karim Man\u00e9 s\u2019engage avec ABC Fighters pour les \u00e9liminatoires de la BAL | Wiwsport</cite></a>&#160;\u00bb, <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2024-09-27\" data-sort-value=\"2024-09-27\">27 septembre 2024</time> <small style=\"line-height:1em;\">(consult\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2025-08-08\" data-sort-value=\"2025-08-08\">8 ao\u00fbt 2025</time>)</small></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"ouvrage\" id=\"Bassine2025\"><span class=\"ouvrage\" id=\"Pape&#95;Mor&#95;Bassine2025\">Pape Mor <span class=\"nom&#95;auteur\">Bassine</span>, \u00ab&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://jolofsport.com/basket-transfert-karim-mane-rejoint-calgary-surge/\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\">Basket-transfert&#160;: Karim Man\u00e9 rejoint Calgary Surge - Jolof Sport</cite></a>&#160;\u00bb, <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2025-04-12\" data-sort-value=\"2025-04-12\">12 avril 2025</time> <small style=\"line-height:1em;\">(consult\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2025-08-08\" data-sort-value=\"2025-08-08\">8 ao\u00fbt 2025</time>)</small></span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-5\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"ouvrage\">\u00ab&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiwsport.com/2025/08/25/mercato-basket-karim-mane-rejoint-le-rouen-metropole-basket/\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\">Mercato - Basket&#160;: Karim Man\u00e9 rejoint le Rouen M\u00e9tropole Basket&#160;! | Wiwsport</cite></a>&#160;\u00bb, <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2025-08-25\" data-sort-value=\"2025-08-25\">25 ao\u00fbt 2025</time> <small style=\"line-height:1em;\">(consult\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2025-08-25\" data-sort-value=\"2025-08-25\">25 ao\u00fbt 2025</time>)</small></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-6\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-6\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"ouvrage\" id=\"Lequotidien2024\"><span class=\"nom&#95;auteur\">Lequotidien</span>, \u00ab&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lequotidien.sn/fsbb-karim-mane-r